== trapped
    VG [10 ON ERROR GOTO 90 | 20 DATA 12X | 30 READ A | 40 END | 90 PRINT ERR;ERL:END | RUN |  2  20]
    ZB [10 ON ERROR GOTO 90 | 20 DATA 12X | 30 READ A | 40 END | 90 PRINT ERR;ERL:END | RUN |  2  20]
== untrap
    VG [20 DATA 12X | 30 READ A | RUN | Syntax error in 20]
    ZB [20 DATA 12X | 30 READ A | RUN | Syntax error in 20]
== listdot
    VG [20 DATA 12X | 30 READ A | RUN | Syntax error in 20 | LIST . | 20 DATA 12X]
    ZB [20 DATA 12X | 30 READ A | RUN | Syntax error in 20 | LIST . | 20 DATA 12X]
== direct
    VG [20 DATA 12X | READ A | Syntax error in 20 | PRINT ERL |  20]
    ZB [20 DATA 12X | READ A | Syntax error in 20 | PRINT ERL |  20]
== directdot
    VG [10 PRINT | 20 DATA 12X | LIST 10 | 10 PRINT | READ A | Syntax error in 20 | LIST . | 20 DATA 12X]
    ZB [10 PRINT | 20 DATA 12X | LIST 10 | 10 PRINT | READ A | Syntax error in 20 | LIST . | 20 DATA 12X]
== after
    VG [10 ON ERROR GOTO 90 | 20 DATA 12X | 25 DATA 5 | 30 READ A | 40 READ A$:READ B:PRINT A$;B:END | 90 RESUME NEXT | RUN | 12X 5]
    ZB [10 ON ERROR GOTO 90 | 20 DATA 12X | 25 DATA 5 | 30 READ A | 40 READ A$:READ B:PRINT A$;B:END | 90 RESUME NEXT | RUN | 12X 5]
== reraise
    VG [10 ON ERROR GOTO 100 | 20 ERROR 7 | 30 END | 100 ON ERROR GOTO 0 | RUN | Out of memory in 20]
    ZB [10 ON ERROR GOTO 100 | 20 ERROR 7 | 30 END | 100 ON ERROR GOTO 0 | RUN | Out of memory in 20]
refcache: 7 hit, 7 miss, 7 stored
